      "id": "dec-psp",
      "kind": "decision",
      "status": "superseded",
      "content": "[AI proposal, awaiting the researcher's endorsement] Use the Goedecker-Krack PBE HGH-K pseudopotentials (PyBigDFT Database/psppar/Krack/PBE, XC 11) for all elements: C 4, H 1, N 5, O 6, S 6 valence electrons, giving 226 electrons (113 doubly occupied orbitals) for 6a and 72 (36) for thioxanthone. Reason: one consistent family; the HGH-K+NLCC 'SS' set lacks S. The same PBE pseudopotentials would be used for PBE0, a standard approximation.",
