      "id": "fail-hookean",
      "kind": "failed_attempt",
      "status": "verified",
      "content": "[TOOL] Restraining xTB with ASE Hookean springs at the Table S1 upper bounds (k 5) failed: max violation 1.49 A, 6 > 0.3 A, all too SHORT (ids 5, 6, 11, 13, 15, 22), because Hookean acts only above rt and cannot enforce lower bounds. Replaced by a two-sided FlatBottom constraint. Do not reuse Hookean for this.",
