      "kind": "failed_attempt",
      "status": "verified",
      "content": "[TOOL] First PBE0 submission (4 thioxanthone single points, 16 MPI x 2 OMP, 24 GB per job) was OOM-killed after about 8 min, in the input guess and before the first SCF iteration; MaxRSS 23-25 GB per job, no results. BigDFT's own estimate was 501 MB per process (about 8 GB per job): the dry-run memory estimate does not include exact-exchange memory, so a dry run validates hybrid inputs but not their memory. PBE0 memory must be measured before sizing jobs.",
