    {
      "id": "fail-psp-api",
      "kind": "failed_attempt",
      "status": "verified",
      "content": "[TOOL] PyBigDFT 1.9.6 Inputfile.set_psp_krack('PBE', elements=[...]) and set_psp_nlcc(elements=[...]) silently load nothing: set_psp_directory matches psp.endswith(element), but the files are named psppar.X.yaml. Workaround: set_psp_file(filename='.../psppar.X.yaml', element='X') per element, then check that every psppar.X key is present and the electron count is 226 (6a) or 72 (thioxanthone).",
      "tags": [
