    {
      "id": "proc-inputs",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "status": "verified",
      "content": "[TOOL] procedures/make_inputs.py (PyBigDFT 1.9.6) writes 26 self-contained YAML inputs (dft + geopt + embedded Angstrom posinp + psppar from bigdft/psppar via set_psp_file) and index.json. Common: ixc PBE, free boundary conditions, gnrm_cv 1e-5. T1 = spin_polarize(mpol=2) -> nspin 2, mpol 2. Phase 1: tx_S0/T1_pbe_geopt, hgrid 0.35 bohr, rmult (6, 9), SQNM, 300 steps, betax 1.0, forcemax 2e-4 Ha/bohr. Phase 2: 6a S1 S0/T1 single points at hgrid 0.45/0.40/0.35/0.30 x rmult (5,8)/(6,9)/(7,10). Phase 1b: thioxanthone PBE0 single points tx_{S0,T1}_pbe0_at_{S0,T1}pbe at the converged PBE geometries (hgrid 0.35, rmult (6, 9)). Output is deterministic (regenerated byte-identical). procedures/dry_run.py runs SystemCalculator(dry_run=True) on a directory of inputs and writes a summary; procedures/run_bigdft.slurm runs one input (mpirun -np $SLURM_NTASKS --map-by slot:PE=$OMP_NUM_THREADS bigdft -n NAME).",
