      "id": "proc-p2-workflow",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "status": "verified",
      "content": "[TOOL] Stage pipeline (phase2/inputs): 01 T1 reruns; 02 PBE at S1 writing wavefunctions; 03 PBE0 at S1 (restart from 02); 04 free SQNM geopt; 05 constrained SQNM geopt (Frozen: fxyz on 55 atoms, restart from 02); 06 PBE at the constrained minima writing wavefunctions; 07 PBE0 at the constrained minima (restart from 06). Geopt settings as the thioxanthone protocol (SQNM, 300 steps, betax 1.0, forcemax 2e-4, frac_fluct 1.0). Grid Engine array jobs via scripts/run_array*.sh; every input passes scripts/dryrun_dir.sh first; analysis/collect_evidence.py condenses logs into the evidence files; tests/test_phase2_evidence.py checks them.",
